    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Royal County, Navan`s Premier Estate Agents, are delighted to present 42 Millbrook, Johnstown, Navan, Co. Meath, a well-maintained two-bedroom ground-floor apartment for sale in this popular residential area of Navan.\n\n\nBenefiting from its own door entrance, this bright and spacious apartment is presented in very good condition throughout. The property has been well cared for, with both the kitchen and bathroom upgraded in a modern style, adding to its overall appeal.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a generous open-plan living and dining area, seamlessly connected to the modern fitted kitchen. An inner hallway leads to two well-proportioned bedrooms, a stylish family bathroom and a useful hot press/storage area.\n\n\nExternally, 42 Millbrook benefits from communal parking to the rear. The property also enjoys direct access to Johnstown People`s Park, providing an excellent outdoor amenity right on the doorstep.\n\n Millbrook is a well-established residential development in Johnstown, Navan, Co. Meath. The property is conveniently located within walking distance of Johnstown Shopping Centre, the IDA Business Park and local schools, as well as a wide range of everyday amenities.\n\nNavan Town Centre is also within easy reach, offering an extensive selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, leisure facilities and services. \n\nFor commuters, the property is conveniently positioned for access to Junction 8 of the M3 motorway, providing excellent connectivity to the M50 and Dublin.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
